    <string name="rules_title">Rules</string>
    <string name="rules_text">The board is divided into colored regions — one for each row.\n\n• Every row, every column and every region must contain exactly one cat.\n• There must be at least one empty cell between any two cats: they may not touch sideways or diagonally.\n\nEvery level can be solved by logic alone, without guessing. The game does not tell you whether a mark is right — that is for you to figure out. Once all the cats are in their places, the level is complete.</string>
